;N.&#95;NixonCecil&#95;B.&#95;Johnson1975\" class=\"citation\">Edmon. Wong; Leon N. Nixon; Cecil B. Johnson, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220504024700/https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/jf60199a044\">Volatile medium chain fatty acids and mutton flavor</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"美國化學學會\">美國化學學會</a>, 1975-05-01 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2022-05-04</span>&#93;</span>, （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/jf60199a044#\">原始內容</a>存檔於2022-05-04） <span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"連接到英語網頁\">（英語）</span></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E6%B0%A3%E5%91%B3&amp;rft.atitle=Volatile+medium+chain+fatty+acids+and+mutton+flavor&amp;rft.au=Cecil+B.+Johnson&amp;rft.au=Edmon.+Wong&amp;rft.au=Leon+N.+Nixon&amp;rft.date=1975-05-01&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%B8%E5%AD%B8%E6%9C%83&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fpubs.acs.org%2Fdoi%2F10.1021%2Fjf60199a044%23&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Zald, David H.; Pardo, J. V. (1997). \"Emotion, olfaction, and the human amygdala: Amygdala activation during aversive olfactory stimulation\". PNAS. 94 (8): 4119–24. Bibcode:1997PNAS...94.4119Z. doi:10.1073/pnas.94.8.4119. PMC 20578. <a class=\"external mw-magiclink-pmid\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/9108115?dopt=Abstract\">PMID 9108115</a>. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Herz, Rachel S. (2004). \"A Naturalistic Analysis of Autobiographical Memories Triggered by Olfactory Visual and Auditory Stimuli\". Chem. Senses. 29 (3): 217–24. doi:10.1093/chemse/bjh025. <a class=\"external mw-magiclink-pmid\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/15047596?dopt=Abstract\">PMID 15047596</a> </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Larsson, M.; Willander, J. (2009). \"Autobiographical odor memory\". Ann. N.Y. Acad. Sci. 1170 (1): 318–23. Bibcode:2009NYASA1170..318L. CiteSeerX 10.1.1.656.6053. doi:10.1111/j.1749-6632.2009.03934.x. <a class=\"external mw-magiclink-pmid\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19686154?dopt=Abstract\">PMID 19686154</a>. S2CID 40423777 </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-10\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Wrzesniewski, Amy; McCauley, Clark; Rozin, Paul (1999). \"Odor and Affect: Individual Differences in the Impact of Odor on Liking for Places, Things and People\". Chem. Senses. 24 (6): 713–21. doi:10.1093/chemse/24.6.713. <a class=\"external mw-magiclink-pmid\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/10587506?dopt=Abstract\">PMID 10587506</a>. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-11\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Epple, Gisela; Herz, Rachel S. (1999). \"Ambient odors associated to failure influence cognitive performance in children\". Developmental Psychobiology. 35 (2): 103–07. doi:10.1002/(sici)1098-2302(199909)35:2&lt;103::aid-dev3&gt;3.0.co;2-4. <a class=\"external mw-magiclink-pmid\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/10461124?dopt=Abstract\">PMID 10461124</a>. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-12\"><span cla